WEBVTT

00:09:29.857 --> 00:09:31.025
In the morning,

00:09:31.066 --> 00:09:34.653
children spend the morning time
learning the normal classes

00:09:34.695 --> 00:09:36.739
they're supposed to take in the curriculum

00:09:36.739 --> 00:09:39.116
and then spend about one hour
in the afternoon

00:09:39.158 --> 00:09:42.077
to put what they've learned
in the morning into practice.

00:09:42.703 --> 00:09:46.373
Beyond being a game that is helping
children master the curriculum content

00:09:46.415 --> 00:09:48.626
and do well in the national exam,

00:09:48.667 --> 00:09:51.629
my team and I are committed
to continue building the 5 STA-Z

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.838
into a learning resource

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.966
that will continue to put a smile
on these children's faces,

00:09:56.008 --> 00:09:58.093
every single day they come to class

00:09:58.093 --> 00:10:00.471
and a game that can continue
to inspire them